menu "MixOS board verification"
config MIXOS_STC_CALIBRATION_VERIFIED
    bool "Board STC3117 calibration and cold-start initialization verified"
    default n
    help
        Leave disabled until the actual board's gauge calibration and its
        persistence across cold starts have been verified with ESP permanently
        owning the I2C MUX. MixOS intentionally does not invent CC_CNF/VM_CNF.
        When disabled raw SOC is displayed as unverified, capacity learning and
        runtime estimates are disabled. This is not battery charging control.
endmenu
